{#
  One team group: heading, member count, and the grid of cards.

  Expects:
    group ......... an entry from content/settings/team-groups.yaml
    groupMembers .. the already-filtered, already-sorted members for that group
    locale, t ..... supplied by the base layout

  The heading and the filter label both come from the SAME central group
  definition, so they can never drift apart.

  The member count is generated, not stored. English needs two forms and Polish
  needs three ("1 osoba" / "4 osoby" / "5 osób"); the `plural` filter picks the
  right one from the forms in team-groups.yaml.
#}
{%- set g = group[locale.code] -%}
    <div class="team-section" data-group="{{ group.key }}">
      <h2 class="reveal">{{ g.heading }} <span class="count">{{ groupMembers | length | plural(teamGroups.plural[locale.code], locale.code) }}</span></h2>
      <div class="team-grid">

{% for member in groupMembers %}{% set revealIndex = loop.index0 %}{% include "partials/team-card.njk" %}
{% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
